00:37:05,520 --> 00:37:06,720
He's super organized.

464
00:37:07,440 --> 00:37:16,400
And he was already like, he could just continue doing what he was doing anyway because like he was like reporting bucks like crazy anyway.

465
00:37:17,280 --> 00:37:19,440
So that was very, that was very nice.

466
00:37:20,000 --> 00:37:20,800
That's interesting.

467
00:37:20,880 --> 00:37:32,800
I don't, I don't usually hear of Indy's bringing on QA that early, but the jobs where I've had a QA person on our team, it's always like one of the most valuable things you can possibly have.

468
00:37:34,240 --> 00:37:47,680
